0180/extras/225aa7e0f91c6b898e4e9932e61904b9.avif?t=1782492474\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Deluxe Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The base game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Outfit Pack: Run Fast, Riding Sun, Yellow Leaves, Quack &amp; Grind skins</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASSIVE MULTIPLAYER RACES &amp; EVOLVING CONTENT</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290180/extras/be8eff1d0207ebc2b93a56dd08c921d9.poster.avif?t=1782492474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290180/extras/be8eff1d0207ebc2b93a56dd08c921d9.webm?t=1782492474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290180/extras/be8eff1d0207ebc2b93a56dd08c921d9.mp4?t=1782492474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Go head-to-head with over 50 players as you fight your way to the finish line! The Republic is always evolving with seasonal events, new sports, and challenges. Jump into pick-up runs, trick competitions, or laid-back crew rides. There's always a new reason to drop in, send it, and shred the massive multiplayer playground!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A VIBRANT, SEAMLESS OPEN WORLD</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290180/extras/4572057c046b94a6200bfc7c6f7b1173.poster.avif?t=1782492474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290180/extras/4572057c046b94a6200bfc7c6f7b1173.webm?t=1782492474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290180/extras/4572057c046b94a6200bfc7c6f7b1173.mp